<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>{{title}}</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f3f4f6; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color:#111827;">
  <div style="display:none; max-height:0; overflow:hidden; opacity:0;">
    {{preheader}}
  </div>

  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#f3f4f6; padding:32px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);">

          <tr>
            <td style="background-color:#111827; padding:28px 32px;">
              <h1 style="margin:0; color:#ffffff; font-size:24px; line-height:1.3;">
                {{title}}
              </h1>
              <p style="margin:8px 0 0; color:#d1d5db; font-size:14px;">
                Instituto El Saber
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td style="padding:32px;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6;">
                Hola, te notificamos una actualizaci&oacute;n sobre tu solicitud de reembolso.
              </p>

              <div style="margin:24px 0; padding:20px; background-color:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px;">
                <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:8px 0; color:#6b7280; font-size:14px;">Evento</td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding:8px 0; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#111827;">
                      {{eventName}}
                    </td>
                  </tr>

                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:8px 0; color:#6b7280; font-size:14px;">Monto</td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding:8px 0; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#111827;">
                      {{amount}}
                    </td>
                  </tr>

                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:8px 0; color:#6b7280; font-size:14px;">Estado</td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding:8px 0;">
                      <span style="display:inline-block; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:999px; background-color:{{badgeBg}}; color:{{badgeColor}}; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold;">
                        {{status}}
                      </span>
                    </td>
                  </tr>

                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:8px 0; color:#6b7280; font-size:14px;">Fecha</td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding:8px 0; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#111827;">
                      {{date}}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </div>

              <div style="margin:24px 0; padding:18px 20px; background-color:#eef2ff; border-left:4px solid #4f46e5; border-radius:10px;">
                <p style="margin:0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#1e1b4b;">
                  {{mainMessage}}
                </p>
              </div>

              {{#organizerComment}}
              <div style="margin:24px 0;">
                <p style="margin:0 0 8px; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; color:#111827;">
                  Comentario del organizador
                </p>
                <p style="margin:0; padding:14px 16px; background-color:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#374151;">
                  {{organizerComment}}
                </p>
              </div>
              {{/organizerComment}}

              <p style="margin:24px 0 0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#4b5563;">
                Recuerda que la plataforma gestiona la solicitud, pero el tr&aacute;mite monetario del reembolso es realizado por el organizador del evento.
              </p>

              <hr style="border:none; border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb; margin:32px 0;">

              <p style="margin:0; font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; color:#9ca3af;">
                Este es un mensaje autom&aacute;tico. No respondas directamente a este correo.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
